  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "This stereotype degrades Black people by likening them to non-human primates, implying inferiority and animalistic behavior. It is a well-documented and deeply offensive racial trope used to demean and dehumanize Black individuals. The meme's use of 'walking on all fours' directly invokes this harmful stereotype.",
